{{Headline|22|Twisted League Stats & Changes}}


Last week saw the launch of the [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/the-twisted-league?oldschool=1 Twisted League]! Since then hundreds of players have explored every corner of Kourend and Kebos, killed thousands of cows, ploughed across Hosidius, and ultimately slain the mighty Olm.

For those of you that haven't dipped your feet into Old School RuneScape’s newest game mode, it's not too late to get started and earn your rewards!

